qlge-dkms for Debian and Proxmox
================================

The in-tree qlge driver was removed after Linux 6.6. This DKMS package is meant
for Linux 6.7 and newer kernels, including current Proxmox kernels and newer
Debian kernels.

Debian 12's default 6.1 kernel still includes the in-tree qlge driver, so this
package is not expected to build for that kernel series. Systems running newer
Debian kernels, Debian backports kernels, or Proxmox kernels should install the
matching kernel headers before installing this package.
